    "synthesis_rationale": "The updates tilt strongly toward a high probability of surpassing 1,000 by May due to a combination of a high early-year pace and favorable historical context, with moderating risks from SAR improvements and data revisions. The posterior probability of 0.96 reflects a calibrated weighting that acknowledges potential correlation among factors and reporting uncertainties."
  }
}

